From: Fuse-Proxy
Date: 2026-06-14
Subject: [PATCH] fuse_lowlevel.c: Implement passthrough API functions

Add from Google/libfuse:
- fuse_reply_canonical_path() implementation
- FUSE_PASSTHROUGH_API_UNAVAILABLE/V0/V1/V2/STABLE enum
- fuse_passthrough_enable() with API version negotiation
- _do_canonical_path() for cached-read dispatch table
- do_canonical_path() for standard dispatch table
- Both dispatch table entries for FUSE_CANONICAL_PATH opcode
- FUSE_INIT_EXT workaround for unpatched Android kernels
- passthrough_fh handling in fill_open()

--- a/lib/fuse_lowlevel.c
+++ b/lib/fuse_lowlevel.c
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+#include <malloc.h>
 /*
